Error [E0062]: `#PublishedSchema` states a contract — write it with `@`, not `#`
  --> tests/ui/marker_publishedschema_hash.jet:2:2
    |
  2 | #PublishedSchema
    |  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `@` marks a promise about the declaration below it (`@Pure`, `@MustUse`, `@Codable`); `#` is for compiler directives (`#Unsafe`, `#Test`). One glance at the first character tells a reader which it is (D-MARKER-FAMILY1).
 Fix: write `@PublishedSchema` (`@` + the same PascalCase name).
